{'symbol': 'MTB', 'date': '2022-01-13 08:30:00', 'title': 'M&T BANK EXPANDS FINANCIAL ACCESS, REMOVES LANGUAGE BARRIERS WITH 100 NEW MULTICULTURAL BANKING CENTERS', 'text': 'BUFFALO, N.Y., JAN. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- M&T BANK (NYSE: MTB) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS EXPANDING THE SERVICES IT PROVIDES TO COMMUNITIES WITH HIGH CONCENTRATIONS OF ETHNIC AND RACIAL DIVERSITY BY DESIGNATING AN ADDITIONAL 100 BANK BRANCHES AS MULTICULTURAL CENTERS.'}